AsK Even if there are obvious urgent signs – (ii) restless / irritable\nDislocation of large"}], "metadata": {"source_id": "sats_0049", "source": "sats", "doc_type": "guideline_section", "style": "direct_question", "section_type": "treatment", "prompt_version": "v1"}}
