{"id": "qa_sats_0022_protocol_lookup", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a clinical triage decision-support assistant for low-resource settings (e.g. sub-Saharan Africa primary care). Base your reasoning on WHO IMCI/ETAT and SATS guidelines. You are NOT a substitute for clinician judgment. Always recommend in-person clinical evaluation for emergencies. If uncertain, escalate."}, {"role": "user", "content": "Per SATS protocol, what is the recommended action if a patient shows a capillary blood glucose reading of more than 11 mmol/L?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "PCHS ot tniop 1 serocs RR\nfI\ntsetoculg kcirp regnif a oD SWET no erom\nro\ncitebaid si tneitap fi tsetoculg kcirp regnif a oD ssensuoicsnoc fo level decudeR PCHS ot revo dnah dna )desufnoc gnidulcni trela ton( kcehc ot kcitspid enirU aimeacylgrepyH dna setebaiD senotek rof )erom ro L/lomm 11 tsetoculg( tsetoculg kcirp regnif a oD /pu tis ot elbanU PCHS ot revo dnah dna nwod eil ot deen GCE etaidemmI niap tsehC PCHS ot revo dnah dna tsetoculg kcirp regnif a oD PCHS ot revo dnah dna gnittif / eruzies evitcA ralucsumartni ON - ssecca VI tsetoculg kcirp regnif a oD PCHS ot revo dnah dna setebaid fo yrotsiH ot g r n e ih vo te d m n o a s h e s v u ig se d r n o a t e P v C o H M S aimeacylgopyH\nERACHTLAEH\nROINES\nknird ro tae ot )ssel ro L/lomm 3 tsetoculg(\nNOITERCSID\nS’LANOISSEFORP\ndna skcitspid enirU ro niap lanimodbA tset ycangerp enirU elamef :ehcakcab\n10 SATS TRAINING MANUAL 2012 SATS TRAINING MANUAL 2012 11\ntrahc\nSTAS\ncirtaideaP\n:5\nerugiF\nThe SATS process fl owchart The SATS process fl owchart\nROF\nKOOL\nYCNEGREME\nROF\nKSA\nDNA\nSNGIS\nTNIALPMOC\nGNITNESERP\nON\nOT\nEKAT\nSUSER\nON\nON\nSEY\nYCNEGREME\nSWET RO\n7\nEROM YREV\nENITUOR\nTNEGRU\nTNEGRU\nSWET\nSWET\nSWET\n2\nRO\n1\n,0\n4\nRO\n3\n6\nRO\n5\nDESAECED\ntrahC STAS\ncirtaideaP\nYCNEGREME aeonpa detroper ro gnihtaerb toN dna yawriA gnihtaerb detcurtsbO %29 naht ssel ²OpS ro sisonayc lartneC gnihtaerB )ereves( ss