{"id": "qa_sats_0024_protocol_lookup", "messages": [{"role": "system", "content": "You are a clinical triage decision-support assistant for low-resource settings (e.g. sub-Saharan Africa primary care). Base your reasoning on WHO IMCI/ETAT and SATS guidelines. You are NOT a substitute for clinician judgment. Always recommend in-person clinical evaluation for emergencies. If uncertain, escalate."}, {"role": "user", "content": "What does the SATS protocol recommend for assessing burn severity in children under 3 years old?"}, {"role": "assistant", "content": "ROF\nKOOL\n,lacirtcele ,laitnerefmucric( )gnitsaw erev a e m s e e lb d i e si O v( n n o o i i t t i i r r t t u u n n l l a a M M )lacimehc\nTNEGRU\n)teef HTOB fo amedeo gnittip( yrujni eyE setebaid nwonk htiw dlihc llewnU denetaerht ro nepo - erutcarF %01 naht ssel nrub rehto ynA bmil\nSNGIS\nerutcarf desolC tnioj regral fo noitacolsiD eot ro regnif fo noitacolsiD )eot ro regnif ton( SWET DLIHC REGNUOY mc 59 NAHT RELLAMS / SRAEY 3 NAHT REGNUOY 3 2 1 0 1 2 3 o s t l a a e m e lb v r a o o n n m U e la g m a r o ro N f ytiliboM\nERUSAEM\ne ro ro 0 m 5 94 - 04 93 - 62 52 - 02 nah 0 t 2 ssel RR r e o r o 0 m 61 951 - 131 031 - 08 97 - 07 nah 0 t 7 ssel RH\nSNGIS\nLATIV\ntoH sleeF sleeF revO ˚4.83 - ˚53 dloC pmeT ˚4.83 ˚53 rednU e - v se is r n n o U p ot n st i c a a P eR ot e s c tc io a V eR trelA UPVA seY oN amuarT SWET DLIHC REDLO\nETALUCLAC\nllat mc 051 ot 59 / DLO SRAEY 21 ot 3 3 2 1 0 1 2 3 o s t la a e m l k b l r a a o w n nU e la g m a r o ro N f ytiliboM\nSWET\ne ro ro 7 m 2 62 - 22 12 - 71 61- 51 nah 5 t 1 ssel RR r e o r o 0 m 31 921 - 001 99 - 08 97 - 06 nah 0 t 6 ssel RH toH sleeF sleeF revO ˚4.83 - ˚53 dloC pmeT ˚4.83 ˚53 rednU\nLANOITIDDA\ne - v se is r n n o U p ot n st i c a a P eR ot e s c tc io a V eR trelA desufnoC UPVA seY oN amuarT\nNOITAGITSEVNI\nSNOITAGITSEVNI LANOITIDDA ROF KCEHC %29 woleb fi - 20pS kcehC tniop 1 serocs RR fI suser ot evom dna 20 evig SWET no erom ro tset esoculg kcirp re